r the United States moved against Goulart because of what Brazil produced or out of Cold War anti-communism — is where that argument is sharpest.",[{"github":null,"name":"Claude (assistant draft, unreviewed)"}],{"from":1500,"to":2024},[{"ref":"the-brazilian-sugar-cycle"},{"ref":"the-brazilian-sugar-cycle--the-atlantic-slave-trade-to-brazil--caused"},{"ref":"the-atlantic-slave-trade-to-brazil--the-brazilian-gold-cycle--enabled"},{"ref":"the-brazilian-gold-cycle--transfer-of-the-portuguese-court-to-brazil-1807--precondition-of"},{"ref":"transfer-of-the-portuguese-court-to-brazil-1807--strangford-treaty-1810--caused"},{"ref":"strangford-treaty-1810--aberdeen-act-1845--precondition-of"},{"ref":"aberdeen-act-1845--eusebio-de-queiros-law-1850--caused"},{"ref":"the-atlantic-slave-trade-to-brazil--the-brazilian-coffee-cycle--enabled"},{"ref":"the-amazon-rubber-boom"},{"ref":"the-amazon-rubber-boom--the-end-of-the-amazon-rubber-monopoly--precondition-of"},{"ref":"the-brazilian-coffee-cycle--the-1930-revolution-and-the-vargas-era--precondition-of"},{"ref":"the-1930-revolution-and-the-vargas-era--companhia-siderurgica-nacional-1941--caused"},{"ref":"companhia-siderurgica-nacional-1941--us-air-bases-in-the-brazilian-northeast-1942--caused"},{"ref":"the-end-of-the-amazon-rubber-monopoly--the-rubber-battle-1942--precondition-of"},{"ref":"companhia-siderurgica-nacional-1941--petrobras-1953--inspired"},{"ref":"petrobras-1953--the-base-reforms-rally-1964--precondition-of"},{"ref":"profit-remittance-law-1962"},{"ref":"profit-remittance-law-1962--operation-brother-sam-1964--caused"},{"ref":"1964-brazilian-coup-detat--operation-brother-sam-1964--reacted-to"},{"ref":"1964-brazilian-coup-detat--the-brazilian-miracle-1968-1973--enabled"},{"ref":"the-brazilian-miracle-1968-1973--the-brazilian-debt-crisis-1982--caused"},{"ref":"the-brazilian-debt-crisis-1982--1985-brazilian-presidential-election--precondition-of"},{"ref":"1985-brazilian-presidential-election--the-1988-brazilian-constitution